<title>USA: Douglas County, Wash., PUD #1 Wells Hydroelectric.</title>
<headline>Douglas County, Wash., PUD #1 Wells Hydroelectric.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Brothers &amp; Co said Tuesday that acting as agent the firm will be accepting tender offers on the following Douglas County, Wash., P.U.D. #1, Wells Hydroelectric revenue bonds:</p>
<p>Series 1963  4.00 pct due  9/1/18  259561AV0</p>
<p>Series 1965  3.70 pct due  9/1/18  259561AU2</p>
<p>Tenders will be accepted Tuesday 12/3/1996 from 1100 EST to 1400 EST for settlement Friday 12/6/1996.</p>
<p>The Authority reserves the right to reject any or all offers.</p>
<p>Please contact Bob Zmuidins at 212-363-4090 or fax to 212-269-7637.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
